Lloyd Alexander", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "oclc_numbers": ["17172923", "263267", "5514036"], "key": "/books/OL16334541M", "number_of_pages": 144, "works": [{"key": "/works/OL1161297W"}], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "In the five stories included in this collection - \"The Wall,\" \"The Room,\" \"Erostratus,\" \"Intimacy\" and \"The Childhood of a Leader\"--The French master of Existentialism displays his powers of narrative and psychological insight in the stories of a modern Erostratus who is compelled to murder, a psychotic who communicates his hallucinations to his formerly-sane spouse, an unfaithful wife still bound to her impotent husband, a boy's metamorphosis into an anti-semitic fascist, and the astonishing fate of a political prisoner."}, "latest_revision": 38, "revision": 38, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2008-09-23T09:22:26.486659"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-07-16T13:11:30.981309"}}